OL,3,GNEWSATemporary car park plan to replace
OL,4,Alost spaces
OL,5,
OL,6,FPlans have been lodged to build a
OL,7,Ftemporary 186-space car park to replace
OL,8,Fparking lost during building works.
OL,10,FSunderland City Council has applied for
OL,11,Fpermission from its own planning
OL,12,Fdepartment to build a car park at the
OL,13,FSheepfolds Industrial Estate near the
OL,14,FStadium of Light.
OL,16,FThe move is linked to a scheme to build
OL,17,Fhundred of homes in the area and a
OL,18,Fconsultation is expected to take place
OL,19,Fbefore a decision is made on the car
OL,20,Fpark.
OL,23,APub: 05-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
